In `ScriptEditor::_reload_scripts()`:
```
Ref<Script> script = edited_res;
if (script != nullptr) {
	Ref<Script> rel_script = ResourceLoader::load(script->get_path(), script->get_class(), ResourceFormatLoader::CACHE_MODE_IGNORE);
	ERR_CONTINUE(!rel_script.is_valid());
	script->set_source_code(rel_script->get_source_code());
	script->set_last_modified_time(rel_script->get_last_modified_time());
	script->reload();
}
```
In 3.4 `rel_script->get_source_code()` returns updated code. But for some reason in master it returns code before the changes.
